<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan forex market closes for public holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan forex market closes for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's foreign exchange market was closed on Friday for the beginning of a three-day holiday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the Taiwan dollar finished at T$27.546 against Wednesday's T$27.547 close.</p>
<p>Turnover through dealers was an active US$267 million.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on Monday</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
